{"title":"The Winners of the 2026 International Pano Awards","link":"https://kottke.org/26/10/the-winners-of-the-2026-international-pano-awards","date":1792687020000,"content":"\n         \t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1792630739-6060dc2b.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1792630739-6060dc2b.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1792630739-6060dc2b.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1792630761-54efc34a.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1792630761-54efc34a.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1792630761-54efc34a.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1792631523-bcc8e27d.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1792631523-bcc8e27d.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1792631523-bcc8e27d.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1792631340-4d90a42e.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1792631340-4d90a42e.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1792631340-4d90a42e.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1792631054-ade916dc.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1792631054-ade916dc.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1792631054-ade916dc.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><a href=\"https://thepanoawards.com/2026-winners-gallery\">The winners of the 2026 Epson International Pano awards</a> were announced recently, featuring some of the best panoramic photography in the world. Alan Taylor at the Atlantic <a href=\"https://www.theatlantic.com/photography/2026/10/winners-2026-epson-international-pano-awards/689074?gift=j9r7avb6p-KY8zdjhsiSZ6WaEKPnt4eHEgYyRVz6VGM\">shared some of his favorites</a> and I shared some of mine above. Starting at the top, photos by Xuecheng Liu, Shimon Perlstein, Tomás Sánchez Ruiz, Preeti &amp; Prashant Chacko, and Daniel Viñé Garcia.</p>\n\t<p>P.S. In case you were wondering about the aspect ratio of panoramic images: <a href=\"https://thepanoawards.com/preparing-your-images\">according to the submission rules</a>, the image’s longest side needs to be at least twice the length as the shortest side.\n</p>\n \n\n        \n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/best%20of\">best of</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/best%20of%202026\">best of 2026</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/photography\">photography</a></p>\n        \n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"4db21aaf9a62f29e38deaa0b9e6d0163b183148cea0771bc868ee54d02ff6dfa","category":"Sites"}